      "shots": [
        {
          "id": "S01",
          "narration_id": "N1",
          "text": "1977年夏天，一张25美元罚单飘过纽约街头。",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.631,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.26,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.15,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0788,
          "speech_start": 0.03,
          "speech_end": 4.81,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.2
        },
        {
          "id": "S02",
          "narration_id": "N1",
          "text": "它轻轻落在一辆黄色老式轿车的挡风玻璃上。",
          "start": 5.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.435,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.07,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.96,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.96,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 5.03,
          "speech_end": 8.99,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
        },
        {
          "id": "S03",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "1976年夏天，纽约酷热难耐，夜晚的街头却越来越安静。",
          "start": 10.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 8.011,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.62,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.51,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.76,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1147,
          "speech_start": 10.03,
          "speech_end": 16.79,
          "characters": 24,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.429
        },
        {
          "id": "S04",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "7月29日深夜，在布朗克斯，一对年轻情侣在车里遇袭。",
          "start": 17.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 7.5,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 7.18,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 7.07,
          "spoken_seconds": 6.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0443,
          "speech_start": 17.03,
          "speech_end": 23.82,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
        },
        {
          "id": "S05",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "凶手用一把.44口径左轮手枪，没留下任何线索。",
          "start": 24.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.304,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.97,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.86,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0169,
          "speech_start": 24.03,
          "speech_end": 29.81,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S06",
          "narration_id": "N2",
          "text": "此后一年，袭击一次次发生在皇后区和布朗克斯。",
          "start": 30.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.4,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.13,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.02,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.81,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0427,
          "speech_start": 30.03,
          "speech_end": 34.84,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 4.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S07",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "从此纽约人互相提醒：天黑以后，别在车里待着。",
          "start": 35.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.75,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.64,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.64,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 35.03,
          "speech_end": 39.67,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S08",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "女人们纷纷剪短头发、换发色，有的人干脆不出门。",
          "start": 42.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.095,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.71,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.6,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.6,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 42.03,
          "speech_end": 47.63,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.857
        },
        {
          "id": "S09",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "1977年4月，凶手在案发现场留下了一封信。",
          "start": 49.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.329,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.9,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.79,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 49.03,
          "speech_end": 53.82,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S10",
          "narration_id": "N3",
          "text": "信的署名，是三个字：山姆之子。",
          "start": 55.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.307,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.74,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.63,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.63,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 55.03,
          "speech_end": 58.66,
          "characters": 12,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S11",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "五月，他又写信给《每日新闻》专栏作家吉米·布雷斯林。",
          "start": 60.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.631,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.31,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.2,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.2,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 60.03,
          "speech_end": 65.23,
          "characters": 21,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S12",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "信里问：7月29日，也就是他的首案周年，你会送我什么？",
          "start": 67.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.921,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.55,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.44,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.44,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 67.03,
          "speech_end": 72.47,
          "characters": 23,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
        },
        {
          "id": "S13",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "那一天，正是他第一次作案的周年。",
          "start": 74.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.005,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.67,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.56,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.56,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 74.03,
          "speech_end": 77.59,
          "characters": 14,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S14",
          "narration_id": "N4",
          "text": "警方成立了庞大的专案组，通宵追查。",
          "start": 80.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.831,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.42,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.31,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.31,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 80.03,
          "speech_end": 83.34,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S15",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "7月31日深夜，布鲁克林海湾区，又一对年轻人遇袭。",
          "start": 85.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.827,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 6.5,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 6.39,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
          "tempo_factor": 1.1072,
          "speech_start": 85.03,
          "speech_end": 90.81,
          "characters": 22,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S16",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "邻居西西莉亚·戴维斯出门遛狗，看到了什么？",
          "start": 91.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.12,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.81,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.7,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.7,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 91.03,
          "speech_end": 95.73,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S17",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "一个男人从黄色福特车上取走了一张罚单。",
          "start": 97.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.027,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.71,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.6,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.6,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 97.03,
          "speech_end": 101.63,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S18",
          "narration_id": "N5",
          "text": "她还说，那晚警察一直在街上开罚单。",
          "start": 103.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.307,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.07,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.96,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.96,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 103.03,
          "speech_end": 106.99,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S19",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "探长贾斯特斯翻遍了当晚开出的所有罚单。",
          "start": 108.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.005,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.73,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.62,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.62,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 108.03,
          "speech_end": 111.65,
          "characters": 18,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
        },
        {
          "id": "S20",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "其中一张罚单的车牌，来自北边的扬克斯。",
          "start": 114.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.005,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.81,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.7,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.7,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 114.03,
          "speech_end": 117.73,
          "characters": 17,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
        },
        {
          "id": "S21",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "他拨通了扬克斯警局的电话。",
          "start": 120.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.111,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 2.8,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 2.69,
          "spoken_seconds": 2.69,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 120.03,
          "speech_end": 122.72,
          "characters": 12,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S22",
          "narration_id": "N6",
          "text": "接电话的调度员，叫惠特·卡尔。",
          "start": 125.0,
          "duration": 5.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.214,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.86,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.75,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.75,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 125.03,
          "speech_end": 128.78,
          "characters": 12,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.4
        },
        {
          "id": "S23",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "更巧的是，惠特的父亲山姆·卡尔不久前报过警：",
          "start": 130.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 5.155,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.95,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.84,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.84,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 130.03,
          "speech_end": 134.87,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S24",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "自家的黑色拉布拉多被人打伤，还收到恐吓信。",
          "start": 137.0,
          "duration": 7.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.3,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.91,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.8,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.8,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 137.03,
          "speech_end": 140.83,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
        },
        {
          "id": "S25",
          "narration_id": "N7",
          "text": "扬克斯警方早就在怀疑同一个邻居。",
          "start": 144.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.622,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.35,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.24,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.24,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 144.03,
          "speech_end": 147.27,
          "characters": 15,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.5
        },
        {
          "id": "S26",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "8月10日夜，警方在扬克斯公寓外等到了他。",
          "start": 150.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.214,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.9,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.79,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.79,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 150.03,
          "speech_end": 153.82,
          "characters": 19,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
        },
        {
          "id": "S27",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "走出大门的，是24岁的邮局职员大卫·伯科维茨。",
          "start": 156.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 6.014,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 5.73,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 5.62,
          "spoken_seconds": 5.62,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 156.03,
          "speech_end": 161.65,
          "characters": 20,
          "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S28",
          "narration_id": "N8",
          "text": "他停下脚步，说：好吧，你们抓到我了。",
          "start": 162.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.5,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 4.14,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 4.03,
          "spoken_seconds": 4.03,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 162.03,
          "speech_end": 166.06,
          "characters": 14,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.333
        },
        {
          "id": "S29",
          "narration_id": "N9",
          "text": "他被判终身监禁，纽约终于松了一口气。",
          "start": 168.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 4.307,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.95,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.84,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.84,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 168.03,
          "speech_end": 171.87,
          "characters": 16,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.667
        },
        {
          "id": "S30",
          "narration_id": "N9",
          "text": "一张小小的罚单，抓住了大案子。",
          "start": 174.0,
          "duration": 6.0,
          "source_seconds": 3.5,
          "natural_clip_seconds": 3.287,
          "natural_speech_seconds": 3.25,
          "spoken_seconds": 3.25,
          "tempo_factor": 1.0,
          "speech_start": 174.03,
          "speech_end": 177.28,
          "characters": 13,
          "target_chars_per_second": 2.167
        }
      ],
